  <History Date="07-06-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Updated in line with v1.07 charts" />
  <History Date="07-06-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="(adds 'Optical Style' channel, side hang control functions, edge tracking and soft zoom programmers channel functions)" />
  <History Date="18-11-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Updated in line with v1.09 charts (adds dimmer snap on and off to programmers ch)" />
